Package: parano1d-world-wallet
Version: __DEB_VERSION__
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Parano1d World <support@koajent.com>
Depends: curl, unzip, ca-certificates, perl-base
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://parano1dworld.com/desktop-wallet
Description: Parano1d World Desktop Wallet
 Send and receive NOID, Parano1d tokens and NFTs, private chat and mining.
 Keys are created and encrypted on this computer and never leave it.
 During installation the official Electron runtime is downloaded from GitHub
 and checked against a pinned SHA-256 before it is used.
